# DOUBLE (EDIT list, white 4) on a clip with notes past its end (the part was shortened): the clip stays sorted, the notes
# past the end go (they never sounded). Found by the fuzz (inv bit 2).
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
page 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
expect nev 0
listen
setbars 0 4
seedat 0 1 30
seedat 0 1 1200
seedat 0 1 100
setbars 0 1
expect events 3
page 11
tap EDIT
wait 100
expect layview 1
tapkey w3
wait 100
expect inv 0
expect events 4
